{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07638","headline":"放歌行 · 孟云卿","name":"放歌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾观天地图，世界亦可小。\n落落大海中，飘浮数洲岛。\n贤愚与蚁蝨，一种同草草。\n地脉日夜流，天衣有时扫。\n东山谒居士，了我生死道。\n目见难噬脐，心通可亲脑。\n轩皇竟磨灭，周孔亦衰老。\n永谢当时人，吾将宝非宝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟云卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07638.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07638","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}